{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8659.288143,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9081.599729,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9136.029387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9138.780707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9139.996737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9140.781388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9142.570771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9144.247093,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":14613.395583,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14845.450080999999,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14887.862275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14889.118063999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14889.559899,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":21010.419056,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21318.312069,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21366.36395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21368.103207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21369.80647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21371.559568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":21371.976696,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33768.151654,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34069.057713,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34117.826162000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34119.846883000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34121.481933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":34123.182723000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34124.978615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34125.823647000005,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":44844.96457900001,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45342.074585,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45399.157577000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45400.634269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45402.36102800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45404.140696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45405.886894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45407.662536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45409.450356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45411.249473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45413.082742000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45413.218987,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51568.898764000005,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":51840.668036,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":51886.705956000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51888.35202300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51890.096909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51891.711519000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51892.930073,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":62232.551044,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62503.415194,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62548.370526000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62549.934629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62551.572594000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62551.756571000005,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62592.777762000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62594.201875000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62595.899219000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62596.097988,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73276.969111,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larsson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":73710.961304,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larsson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":73761.384753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73762.898231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":73764.560452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73766.277787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73768.070875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73769.485915,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":77711.257491,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77910.735095,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77954.07340200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77955.62350500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77957.224795,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":87196.162763,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":87394.76476,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":87439.080609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":87440.383139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87442.122997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":87442.25804,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91082.899611,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91206.76990700001,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":91247.442112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91248.752805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":91248.87692200001,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96631.76552300001,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":96900.579658,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":96947.130921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96948.485359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96950.20592800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96952.069763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":96952.20908300001,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101424.88173600001,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101652.12925900001,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101697.603241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101698.940313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101700.620201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101701.91276600001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":107136.825456,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":107392.924847,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":107438.939703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107440.728224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107442.249614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107443.99455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":107444.150975,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115979.48744900001,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116337.786365,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116386.475835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116388.151928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116389.804905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116391.616141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116393.380626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116393.661038,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126823.248536,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127209.87203700001,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127263.150533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127264.577881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127266.302035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127268.010867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127269.781321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127271.57485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127273.44453400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":127273.59373800001,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137845.63841299998,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138192.53238599998,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138237.23398599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138238.69529499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138239.55843399998,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138286.30340799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138287.81559299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138289.56343399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138291.352766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138292.550819,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138319.103848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138319.75215299998,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":148957.669787,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":149373.163293,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":149428.81393799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149430.33196299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149431.911149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149433.85872999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":149435.490956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":149437.28614799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149439.026547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149440.82787799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149442.017107,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":151481.528386,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151594.16846299998,"text":"imported to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151633.93933199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151634.30793699998,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":158676.76646299998,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":158948.18248299998,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":158994.54470099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158996.05242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":158997.70516699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158999.529863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159000.745022,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167107.533745,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":167421.559407,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":167465.11942799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":167466.69014199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167467.41510299998,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":167501.58856899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167503.252052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167504.957038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167505.660577,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":179062.536615,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179447.936084,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179501.42721999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179503.10838999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179504.760296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179506.508386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179508.12646099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179509.977597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179511.693118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179512.187663,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":188386.22378899998,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":188689.79158299998,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":188738.03659499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188739.473377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188741.13157199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188742.806723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188743.453987,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":199706.23612299998,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200104.36007,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200153.033286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200154.50959799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200156.093561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200157.86823199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200158.70408999998,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200188.20202899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200188.52779999998,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212312.648005,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":212627.42498799998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212677.330149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":212678.81678599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212680.488082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212682.150294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212684.006538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212685.58232,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224502.247518,"code":1005}]}